# LFS rules for the Space repo.
#
# HF's default .gitattributes covers common ML formats (*.npy, *.safetensors,
# *.bin ...) but NOT *.faiss. Without a rule, the 430MB dense.faiss has no LFS
# path and gets dropped from the commit -- silently. The upload reported
# "Found 31 files ... Committing 30/30" and exited 0, so the only symptom was a
# Space that could not start. Track it explicitly.
*.faiss filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.jsonl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# HF defaults, preserved so this file fully replaces theirs rather than
# clobbering the patterns the platform expects.
*.7z filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.arrow filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
